         ],
         "note": "ink, upright in the lower panel, the same steeply leaning hand as xg976jt9573; read after shearing the line upright. Six figures without separators: 1, 4, 1, 1, 2, 4, giving 14.11.24. The two 4s are written alike, a crossbar with a descender, and are the least certain figures; the 2 has the usual base stroke."
        }
       ]
